# RealWorld against its generated API (conformance/net.mjs): tags, an article (Markdown), history, a failed sign-in (by Enter, then the button).
tap open-how-to-learn-javascript-efficiently
back 1
wheel brand 1400
tap tag-javascript
tap tab-global
wheel tag-javascript -4000
tap brand
tap nav-login
type email nobody@example.invalid
type password wrong-password
type password key Enter
tap submit
back 1
tap nav-register
tap nav-home
